## Standing ALWAYS (fail any → UAT FAIL)

1. **CONSISTENCY** — Cut matches locked prior parts / house: Explorer **scale** + **teal trenchcoat** garnish language, props, period world, 3D-cartoon style. Off-model = fail.
2. **VO VISUAL EXPLAINER** — Picture **matches** and **visually explains** the spoken VO beat. Not pretty B-roll under clever narration. Mute test: you should still follow the beat.
3. **EXPLORER ROUND GLASSES** — Whenever Explorer is visible, **round glasses** on (sheet DNA). Bare / no-glasses Explorer = fail.
4. **LAMP = CLEAN WARM GLOW** — Lamps are a clean warm glow only. Fire spit / candle-flame / smoke lamp artifacts = fail.
5. **READABLE CARDS** — Cards have readable writing or symbols. Blank stacks / blank hero cards = fail. **Garbled element cards** on the desk (scrambled letters, melted glyphs, unreadable symbols) = fail.
6. **EXPLORER FACE / HAIR — FINISHED** — Explorer hair is a full finished crown. Fail sloppy / unfinished mid-scalp / bald patch. Also fail **face-cloud blot** (soft melted face smear) and **black-hole dots** in scalp / hair.
7. **NO LAMP LAVA DRIP** — No molten / orange leak under the bulb onto chair / desk. Extends clean light — lava drip = fail. **Reinforced:** Ben hit this again on P04 Empty Chairs **`v19`** evening stills — do **not** soft-pass.
8. **LATE SHOTS SHARP + FINISHED** — Final beats stay sharp and finished. Fail heavy motion blur / unfinished desks. Fail **ANY horizontal ghost / double-exposure** on lamp / flasks / grid **even when DNA is painted**. Require **continuous-playback evidence** (scrub the late window) — **not** one still.
9. **FINISHED 3D CARTOON QUALITY (NO UNFINISHED FLAT)** — Picture reads as finished premium **3D cartoon** house. Soft / flat / unfinished animation look that reads incomplete (under-shaded flats, half-built forms, “unfinished anim” softness) = **ALWAYS FAIL**. Standing on every HOS cut — **not v19-only**. Cite Ben OVERRIDE FAIL on P04 Empty Chairs **`v19`** evening stills.

